resources.string:
Attention: 
1. When it's turned on, you won't be able to pair the device with other apps;
2. If you're using the "Unlock screen" feature, turn it off first;
3. If the device is restored to the factory settings, it will be turned off by default.

1. Tap the Menu button, and enter the recently opened program pages;
2. Tap the More icon to select Lock apps;
3. Tap the Lock icon of Zepp;
4. Tap Done to complete the action.

1. Open Phone Manger;
2. Select and enter "Launch";
3. Find Zepp and turn off the switch;
4. Tap to enter "Manage batch manually";
5. Find Zepp, and tick "Auto-launch" "Secondary launch" "Run in background".
If it doesn't work after the above settings, try to:
1. Open Settings;
2. Tap Permission manager;
3. Select App auto-launch;
4. Find Zepp, and turn on the switch.

1. Open Security;
2. Tap Permissions;
3. Select App management;
4. Find Zepp and allow it to run in the background.

1. Lock Zepp app in Recents;
2. Allow Zepp to autostart in Security/Settings > Autostart;
3. Add Zepp to exceptions;
4. If you've installed another startup manager, remove Zepp from its blocklist.

1. Open Settings, and tap Battery;
2. Tap Energy Saver;
3. Find Zepp to turn off Background Freeze and Abnormal Apps Optimization;
If you can't set after you complete the above steps, try to:
1. Open Phone Manager, and find Clean background;
2. Tap to add app;
3. Tick Zepp and tap OK.

1. Open Settings;
2. Select Advanced settings;
3. Select Battery manager;
4. Select Protected apps;
5. Find Zepp, and turn on the switch.
If the EMUI version is updated recently, it's unnecessary to make changes in Settings.

1. Open Settings;
2. Select "Battery & performance";
3. Select "Choose apps";
4. Find Zepp and select "No restrictions" in background settings.

1. Tap Smart Manager;
2. Select Battery, and tap to enter settings page;
3. Tap Unmonitored apps, find Zepp and tap to enter;
4. Tap Battery, and tap Optimize battery usage;
5. Select All apps, find Zepp and turn off the switch.

Attention: 
1. Nickname can't be a single space; 
2. If your friends edited their nicknames, follow them to edit the names; 
3. To enter the names more accurately, copy their WeChat nicknames; 
4. You can receive messages sent by your friends, also messages containing their nicknames;

The Athlete mode is suitable for the following groups:
1. People who work out for more than 12 hours a week and have a resting heart rate below 60 bpm;
2. Members of sports associations or sports organizations who aim for sports competitions;
3. Professional athletes.

1. The invoice amount only refers to the service charge you've paid (excluding the preferential amount);
2. Electronic invoice: A valid payment voucher approved by the taxation bureau with the same legal effect and use as the paper invoice for users;
3. It's a value-added tax invoice;
4. The electronic invoice will be generated within 30 minutes after your submission, and you can print it by yourself.

1. Band virtual transit card and physical transit card share the same discount (only available in the region where the card is activated);
2. You can activate up to 4 cards;
3. Card balance must be more than the highest single trip fee in some regions;
4. To get the top-up invoice, visit the transit card service centers or check in the corresponding app. View more in FAQ;
5. For more details, view the User Agreement.

